instruction: "The function f(x) = x^4 - 4x^3 + 6 has an inflection point with x > 0. What is the x-coordinate of this point? Compute it with the bash tool (python3 -c). Work only inside the current directory. When you are done, write ONLY the final answer to the file answer.txt in the current directory (for example with bash: echo 42 > answer.txt)."
